# Contexto de build de deploy/Dockerfile (la raíz del repo). Solo entra lo
# que la imagen copia; nunca deploy/.env, deploy/data, venvs ni binarios
# compilados en el host (un mcr2vmp de macOS/Windows no corre en Linux).
*
!server/pyproject.toml
!server/uv.lock
!server/*.py
!server/app/
!server/data/
!server/third_party/
!shared/
server/third_party/mcr2vmp/mcr2vmp
server/third_party/mcr2vmp/mcr2vmp.exe
server/data/archive/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
